title: "Align Studio (AI Compose): Open-Source iOS AI Smart Framing & Photo Composition Camera"
message: "If you use this software or reference its architecture, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Tran"
    given-names: "Van Khoa"
    alias: "Ace4youblade"
repository-code: "https://github.com/emlavankhoahienma-hue/ai-smart-framing-camera"
abstract: >-
  Align Studio (AI Compose) is an open-source iOS 17+ camera application written in Swift, SwiftUI, Metal, Apple Vision, and CoreML (ANE). It provides real-time AI Compose, AI Smart Framing, automated photography composition guidance (Rule of Thirds, Golden Ratio, Symmetry, Horizon), 6-DoF Gyroscope EKF target tracking, and context-aware smart optical zoom.
keywords:
